FM1 Open V14 source preview backend

This backend compiles M-VAVE's public browser instrument source as native C.
It is a preview of FM1 Open, not the exact compiled hardware firmware engine.
The proprietary FM1 binary SDK is neither linked nor included. Voice limits,
demo samples and hardware integration can differ from the physical firmware.

